{"id": "67302", "title": "截教小小山神", "author": "浪子牧守", "category": "武侠修真", "count": 59, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/67/67302/67302s.jpg", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/67/67302.htm", "intro": "混沌无穷，世界无极。老子无为，原始傲，通天虽狂且有情有义，我本山神，山之道乃厚重，沉稳。然我既入截教，应做那截教的一座山，为截教挣那一线生机，为那截教我愿剑走偏锋挣那万劫昌盛，百死不悔。\r\n     通天落泪，原始悲苦，老子心酸谁的错？哪怕原始愿背负那引狼入室之名也无悔，谁知其中苦？谁言圣人无情？谁言圣人视众生为蝼蚁？", "base": "files/article/html/67/67302", "chapters": [{"title": "开一章答谢", "file": "10348874.html", "available": false}, {"title": "想找人交流下", "file": "10348875.html", "available": false}, {"title": "谢谢大家", "file": "10348876.html", "available": false}, {"title": "001 重生为小山", "file": "10348877.html", "available": false}, {"title": "002 方之此方为洪荒", "file": "10348878.html", "available": false}, {"title": "003 凝练身体", "file": "10348879.html", "available": false}, {"title": "oo4 身外化形", "file": "10348880.html", "available": false}, {"title": "005 惬意的小日子", "file": "10348881.html", "available": false}, {"title": "006 得到半截鸿蒙紫气（2和1）", "file": "10348882.html", "available": false}, {"title": "007 冥河陨落？？？", "file": "10348883.html", "available": false}, {"title": "008 血海不枯冥河不死", "file": "10348884.html", "available": false}, {"title": "009 雷劫至化形而出", "file": "10348885.html", "available": false}, {"title": "010 五庄观问道", "file": "10348886.html", "available": false}, {"title": "011 拜师通天", "file": "10348887.html", "available": false}, {"title": "012 修真听道", "file": "10348888.html", "available": false}, {"title": "013 三清分家", "file": "10348889.html", "available": false}, {"title": "014 十日横空 后羿射日", "file": "10348890.html", "available": false}, {"title": "015巫妖大战", "file": "10348891.html", "available": false}, {"title": "016 巫妖没落", "file": "10348892.html", "available": false}, {"title": "017 天庭新立 山元要入天", "file": "10348893.html", "available": false}, {"title": "018 万山至尊山岳大帝", "file": "10348894.html", "available": false}, {"title": "019", "file": "10348895.html", "available": false}, {"title": "020 心魔横生", "file": "103